    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wughoma ghwa Mlungu kwa Waisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Da niakotia welee, huwu Mlungu oowilegha wandu wake? Hata kutini. Ini moni ne Muisraeli, kivalwa cha Abrahamu, wa mbari ya Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wafil. 3.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ndewileghie wandu wake awo orewimanyireghe kufuma imbiri. Wele ndemmanyire agho ghighorelo ni Maandiko aighu ya Elija seji orekoghe ukimvoya Mlungu aighu ya Israeli ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwana, wawibwaghie walodi wako, na kurivuchua madhabahu rako, nani naasighwa niekeri; nawo waawuyalola kunibwagha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 19.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mlungu wamtumbulie wada? “Neko na wandu elfu mfungade wisemdungie Baali ngokoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 19.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni huwo koni idana; weko wandu watini wisigharikie, awo Mlungu uwisaghue kwa mvono ghwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ikakaia uko kusaghulwa ni kwa mvono, ndekukaiagha sena kwa mabonyo anduangi; ngera ni huwo kumangu mvono si mvono ghungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Da ni wada? Icho Waisraeli werechilolagha cheewilema kupata. Wasaghulwa awo wapatire, ela wazima wikaakurishwa ngolo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sa iji koni iandikilo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana nakotia, Wayahudi weekuwa wipate kughwa putu? Hata kutini. Ela kwa chia ya kiwiwi chawo, kukia kwawivikie wandu wa mbari zima; eri Waisraeli wiwado ni iriso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana ikakaia ikosa jawo jiareda mecha wurumwengunyi kwa wungi, na kulemwa kwawo kuareda mecha kwa wandu wa mbari zima kwa wungi, kukata kwawo-lee kuchachumba saki kureda marasimio?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukia kwa wandu wa mbari zima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana niaghora nenyo wandu wa mbari zima, ini moni ngikaia mdumi wa iro mbari zima; naghukasa wudumiki ghwapo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri niwibonye wamzedu Wayahudi kukaia na iriso, na kwa chia iyo nikire wamu wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikakaia kuleghwa kwawo kuaghuredia wurumwengu kupatana na Mlungu, kurumirilwa kwawo-lee kuchakaia wada? Si irangi kwa awo wifue?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikakaia idonge ja mufu ghwa mkate jifunyiro kizongona sa mavalo gha imbiri jaelie, huwo koni mufu ghose ghooela; na ikakaia kirimba cha mudi chaelie, mbashu wori raelie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ngera awo sa mbashu ra mzeituni rerechikanyiroghe, na oho sa lumbashu lwa mzeituni ghwa isakenyi kukakakadishirwa wulalo ghwawo, eri kuwaghilo kuja kudeghedeka ni mzeituni ghwa loli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusekukase aighu ya mbashu. Kukakukasa, manya oho suo ungi kwawuyachimazira kirimba ela kirimba nicho chawuyakumazira oho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadima kughamba, “Mbashu redechikanywa niwone kakadishirwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ni loli. Ela redechikanywa angu wileghie kurumiria, na oho kwaawuyamanga kwa ijo irumirio jeni. Kwa huwo kusekukase, ela kuobuo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ngera Mlungu ndererilekieghe rija mbashu ra asili, huwo koni ndechaakuleka oho wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana wona wucha ghwa Mlungu na kubia kwake. Wabirie kwa awo wighue, ela ni mucha kwako, ikakaia kwadua andenyi ya ugho wucha ghwake; si huwo, na oho wori kuchadumbulwa wokoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na awo Wayahudi wori iji wasigha uko kulegha kurumiria kwawo, wichawunjwa andu kwawo kwa imbiri; angu Mlungu oko nandighi rewiwunja sena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ngera oho mundu wa mbari zima kwa asili kuko sa mzeituni ghwa isakenyi, kwadumbulo na kukakadishirwa kwa mzeituni ghwa mbuwenyi kwa asili ghuseko ghwako, kuchumba nandighi mbashu ra mizeituni ya mbuwenyi richakakadishirwa kwa mudi ghwawo ghoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wughoma ghwa Mlungu kwa wose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanidu, nakunde mmanye maza iri rivisikie, msechekalikia kwa kumanya konyu. Kughilika kwa Waisraeli kuchakaia kwa ngelo imu, hata mtalo ghwa wandu wa mbari zima wimghalukiagha Mlungu ghukatie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa huwu Waisraeli wose wichakia, sa iji iandikilo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kumkasa Mlungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
